 advanced conquerors  as well as his gear 5th form luffy is  now able to go against the likes of  kaido simply using the little knowledge  of ryo and advanced conquerors he has  luffy as the pirate king should be able  to have complete mastery over future  sight which would make any solid  opponent physically unable to touch him  because he'd just predict their moves  his use of future sight or advanced  observation hockey will probably be as  good as katakuri's was during their  battle on whole cake island luffy by the  end of the series will probably stop  using his gear fourth forms because of  his new arsenal of abilities and  awakening of gear fifth the introduction  in gear fifth which seems to take  inspiration from early cartoons like  popeye and the gorosei hyping the  fruit's ability is only being limited by  luffy's creativity is why he could  potentially start transforming his body  into objects and vehicles in order to do  anything he desires one of luffy's major  issues ever since the start of the time  skip has been the drawbacks of him using  heavy amounts of hockey and while he has  been able to survive in spite of this  the challenges ahead seem more deadly  with the likes of world government teach  and possibly even shanks waiting for him  he will need to learn how to sustain his  hockey more and if not he might lose his  friends family and even his nakama  losses like this might lead him to  breaking down even more than he did at  the end of the marine ford and becoming  way more serious than his usual fun and  adventurous personality is certain that  by the end of the series luffy is going  to become the king of pirates so his  expected bounty by the end of the series  should be around 6 billion bellies which  is almost 500 million more than the  previous pirate king goldie roger and 3  billion more than he's currently worth  in the manga
 

